# ASTRAM_RSS_FEEDS=https://news.google.com/rss/search?q=Bengaluru+news+when:7d&hl=en-IN&gl=IN&ceid=IN:en;https://news.google.com/rss/search?q=Karnataka+news+when:7d&hl=en-IN&gl=IN&ceid=IN:en
